data: {"id": "648cf162e4cc47d3-thinking-parallel_evidence-904", "run_id": "648cf162e4cc47d3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=709 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 6 pending\n[ ] [read-kubectl-desc] 读取 kubectl_", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789103130449, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_15f3b17c2bb240b1b2a4f5fc", "tool_sequence": 10, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=709 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 6 pending\n[ ] [read-kubectl-desc] 读取 kubectl_describe 原始文件和 YAML 摘要以确认 finalizers/Grace Period/容器退出码\n[ ] [read-topology-summary] 读取 topology 摘要以确认控制器/Node/Service 关系\n[ ] [read-pod-logs] 读取 Pod 当前 logs 与 previous logs（app 容器）以确认 SIGKILL/内存不足等线索\n[ ] [read-events-summary] 读取 Pod 事件摘要以确认是否有 finalizer/节点/Kubelet 相关阻塞\n[ ] [read-prometheus-summary] 读取 Prometheus 时序摘要以确认容器重启/phase 数据是否支持 Terminating 结论\n[ ] [synthesize] 综合已有事实，列出支持/反驳 TerminatingStuck 的证据及缺口\n[~] [read-runbook] 读取 pod-terminating-stuck.md runbook 获取标准诊断步骤\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/648cf162e4cc47d3-g1/tools/013-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/648cf162e4cc47d3-g1/tools/013-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/648cf162e4cc47d3-g1/tools/013-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

