data: {"id": "648cf162e4cc47d3-final", "run_id": "648cf162e4cc47d3", "seq": 942, "ts_ms": 1789103174180, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-11/workload 处于 Terminating 状态超过 78 分钟无法删除 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: Terminating (lasts 78m) | 描述长期卡滞的最终状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error (Exit Code: 137) | 确认容器因系统调用终止 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.cpu`: 200m | 提供 OOMKilled 的资源上限上下文 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Event message: `Exit Code: 137` | 独立事件佐证容器非正常退出 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 确认未触发重启策略，Pod 保持初始 Terminating 状态 |\n\n**证据互证说明**：\nK8s State（#1, #2）与 Metric（#5）高度一致，共同印证 Pod 自 78 分钟前因 137 终止后未重启而处于卡死的 Terminating 状态。Event（#4）与 State（#2）相互印证了异常的触发原因，但由于缺失 Topology 证据，无法在事实层面直接证实最终导致停滞的资源清理阻塞机制。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n资源限制 (CPU 200m) → 容器 OOMKilled (Exit Code: 137) → 直接失败 (容器终止) → 用户可见现象 (Pod Terminating 停滞)\n```\n*注：导致“停滞”而非“重启”的具体阻塞机制（如 Finalizer）未确认。*\n\n### 根因结论\n\n证据不足。现有事实足以确认 Pod 异常终止的原因是资源耗尽导致的 OOMKilled，但无法确证 Pod 处于“Terminating”状态停滞的根本原因是资源清理阶段的阻塞。根据配置要求，正式 RCA 中声明的 'aiops.lab/hold' Finalizer 阻塞机制缺乏事实绑定支撑，未能在证据表中得到体现。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 11.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 72.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 72.9s (Evidence 64.7s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.563, "metrics": {"run_id": "648cf162e4cc47d3", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.569904088974, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 91569.904088974, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 63705.963134765625, "tool_calls": 25, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 24, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 79924.01361465454, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 27504.456996917725}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 11433.690547943115, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 72930.85289001465, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7185.579299926758, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

